---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="RC Car Building your own car" description="RC Car Building your own car - readysaltedcode story">
  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/stories">Stories</a>
      </nav>
      <h1>RC Car Building your own car</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <article class="story-content">
    <div class="container">
      <p>Step 1 Login or select IoT Project<br />
      <p>Test and play</p>
      <p>2. Connect this board to the IOIO board</p>
      <p>3. Connect LEDs to the correct pins, (optional) See Blinky IoT</p>
      <p><span style="color: #000080;"><strong>Step 4</strong> Linking IoT to app project<img loading="lazy" class=" size-medium wp-image-280 alignright" src="https://www.readysaltedcode.org/images/FFFFFF-0.png?On2JSVg-4QwQa4Bl1bYa9QnjKVzDWwz1J4LYe6ifwgOyo23ULbu1GSFKij8f2wAyZl1UJI9aylLq-_uHuJZAFSPd=s300" alt="Linking IoT board to app" width="300" height="300" /></span><br />
      <p>The menu bar has the IoT icon. Click this and a small pop up will open showing all of your IoT projects that you have created. Click on the appropriate IoT board project.</p>
      <p><span style="color: #000080;"><strong>Step 5</strong> Lets PLAY</span></p>
      <p>Enjoy and share what you have made with us on twitter @readysaltedcode</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 100%);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 3rem 0;
  }
  .breadcrumb { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .breadcrumb a { color: #ccc; }
  .page-header h1 { color: #fff; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .story-content { padding: 3rem 0; }
  .story-content .container { max-width: 800px; }
  .story-content p { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.8; }
  .story-content img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 1.5rem 0; border-radius: 8px; }
  .story-content a { color: #dd3333; }
  .story-content blockquote { border-left: 4px solid #dd3333; padding-left: 1.5rem; margin: 1.5rem 0; font-style: italic; color: #555; }
  .story-content strong { font-weight: 600; }
</style>
